  "description": "The proposed development comprises a loft conversion incorporating a rear flat roof dormer extension, together with a part single-storey side extension at first-floor level. The loft conversion will include the formation of habitable accommodation within the existing roof space, facilitated by the construction of a rear-facing flat roof dormer. The dormer will provide increased headroom and usable floor space and will be finished in materials to match or complement the existing dwelling. Rooflights may be installed to the front or side roof slopes where required. The proposed first-floor side extension will be constructed above part of the existing ground floor footprint, forming additional internal accommodation at first-floor level. The extension will be designed to integrate with the existing building in terms of scale, roof form, fenestration, and external materials. All works will be carried out in keeping with the character of the existing property and surrounding area."
